# Musik at Control Tower F1's keyboard (TechEffect_Musik, ps2.asm:15597).
# The keyboard is an Obj_InvisibleBlock2 with ObjType_Events index 7 at
# x 776, y 416 -- cells 47-48, row 26. Faced, Musik is $109 alone,
# $C734 (event_flags $24, the shutter at x 760, y 255: slot 0, the gap
# at 47,15) = 1, SXFID_Musik waited out in place, bset #0 on $C717 and
# demo 5, whose $FD slides the shutter open. Anything else faced: $109
# then $004. Before build 73 it was always $109 then $004, and the
# shutter stayed shut.
#
# The save is story_amy_grind on 47,27 with Musik (techs_b $84: bit 7
# and a count of four) in Rolf's list, fourth.

start slot 1 routes/saves/tower_musik.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $3F 47 27
press up                     # face the keyboard
wait idle
press c                      # the menu, TECH
wait idle
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
press c                      # Rolf
wait idle
press down                   # Musik, the fourth
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect script $0109
shot 01_musik
press c
wait idle
wait ticks 60                # demo 5: seven idle reads and $FD
expect no-stderr not ported
walk left 1                  # out of the keyboard's room, round its wall
walk down 7
walk left 5
walk up 16
walk right 5
walk up 2
walk right 1
wait idle
expect level $3F 47 16
shot 02_shutter_open
walk up 2
wait idle
expect level $3F 47 14
